WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.760
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>Piyomon.</i>

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.640
<i>This Digimon is Sora-san's partner.</i>

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.600
LEVEL:ROOKIE

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:23.250
<i>Piyomon's flying wasn't very good,
but it's improving thanks to Sora-san.</i>

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.350
TYPE: BABY BIRD

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.250
SPECIAL MOVE: MAGICAL FIRE

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.250
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.650
<i>Piyomon is in fact a very curious Digimon,</i>

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.690
<i>and has a habit of first pecking
at anything that looks interesting.</i>

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.630
<i>Sounds a little painful...</i>

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.290
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.130
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.170
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:54.070
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.070
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.200
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:52.610
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.570
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:58.300
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.300
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.090
<i>To find the Holy Digimon,</i>

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.880
<i>the children split into two teams
and continued on their journey.</i>

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:19.680
<i>On their way,
Taichi's team reached a ruin,</i>

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:23.580
<i>which turned out
to be an ancient weapon factory.</i>

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.080
<i>Mimi and Palmon
were separated from the team</i>

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:36.440
<i>and attacked by Andromon, an Ultimate
Digimon who was forced to be violent.</i>

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:42.370
<i>However, they were saved by Guardromon
who had awakened from a scrap pile.</i>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.130
<i>As a result
of Andromon's persistent attacks,</i>

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.500
<i>Guardromon fell in battle,
trying to protect Mimi.</i>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:00.510
<i>At that moment, Mimi's anger exploded.</i>

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:05.930
<i>Togemon evolved
into Ultimate Digimon Lilimon</i>

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:12.440
<i>and succeeded in stopping Andromon
with swift and elegant attacks.</i>

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.990
<i>After a victory lingering with sorrow,</i>

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:24.450
<i>Taichi's team left the ruins behind,
renewing their determination.</i>

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.490
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:44.140
It's all jungle as far as I can see...

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:47.890
Do you see anything?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.000
No, it's all clear.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.320
Joe? What's going on?

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.320
I don't know if it's
because of this long trip,

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:02.200
but I think...
I'm starting to get airsick...

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.490
Well, you are the sensitive type.

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:09.580
Don't worry,
you don't need to push yourself.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.250
Sorry... I think I'm at my limit...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.380
Birdramon, let's land real quick
and take a break!

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.010
Okay!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.220
Wait!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.410
Something's coming...

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:30.910
Those are...
Funbeemon.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.910
FUNBEEMON

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.190
Are they coming for us?

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.920
No, they're not...

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:38.230
Looks like they're being chased!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:43.170
WASPMON

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.790
CANNONBEEMON

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:24.300
GARUDAMON OF THE CRIMSON WINGS

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.150
Could that...

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.990
possibly be...

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.870
a Digimon... as well?

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:34.910
Y-Yeah...

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.710
That's a big one!

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.840
This is my first time
seeing something like that too...

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.220
An Ultimate Digimon?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.510
Probably.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.520
The Funbeemon!

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.580
Birdramon!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.730
Okay!

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.590
Meteor Wing!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.230
Here it comes!

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.100
Gabumon!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:32.980
Okay!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.490
Petit Fire!

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.150
Birdramon, into the forest!

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:41.400
Roger!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.240
Senpai!

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.410
Joe!

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.120
I'm done for!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.170
And Joe Senpai and Gomamon?

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.700
They should've fallen around here.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.120
Gomamon's with him,
so I think they should be fine...

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.450
Hm?

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.590
Whoa!

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:53.930
Are you okay?!

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.570
Don't worry.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:09.610
We won't capture you or anything.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:11.070
Yeah.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.740
I'm Sora.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.630
<i>Hey, Funbeemon,
what in the world is going on here?</i>

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:31.720
Funbeemon, everyone, they all get turned
into Cannonbeemon's soldiers...

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.590
What?!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.740
We get taken away...

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.470
Cannonbeemon...

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.700
That's the giant one floating
in the sky, right?

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:45.400
Everyone... everyone was captured...

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.400
Yamato...

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:54.030
Weren't those guys emitting
that dark miasma?

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.450
I see...

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:59.720
So that's how they're growing
their forces...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.000
That's awful...

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:07.230
Help me please!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.610
This voice!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.550
Somebody!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.640
I-I can't take it anymore...

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.690
Joe, hang on!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:24.600
Oh yeah, Gomamon, evolve...

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.600
Actually, never mind.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.490
Sora!

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:42.040
Joe Senpai and Gomamon got taken
inside Cannonbeemon!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.540
Oh, no!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.040
We have to save them!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.750
-Piyomon!
-Okay!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:47.830
Wait!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.670
I have an idea.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:58.640
Oh!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:09:59.990
Koshiro!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.180
You know what's up ahead?

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:05.250
The thing is...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:09.750
my tablet hasn't been connecting well
since earlier...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:15.490
Oh, again?
It's been like that a lot lately.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:17.070
Maybe it broke?

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.990
I don't think it would though...

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:26.020
Don't worry, if I ask my grandpa,
you can get our company's latest model!

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.340
Or maybe it'll work
if we just whack it a little?

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.960
Is this where I come in?

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.020
What?!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:37.430
Koshiro-san, why don't you move
somewhere with better reception?

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.910
That's true. Maybe then it'll work...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:45.230
All right, let's keep climbing like this
and get somewhere high.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.270
Yeah!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.000
Petit Fire!

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.190
Magical Fire!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:07.200
Everybody, I came to help! C'mon!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.190
Now's your chance
to escape with everyone, Funbeemon!

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.170
Okay, Sora!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.770
Here they come.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:31.480
Don't resist.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.690
I know...

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.150
Joe!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.400
Where are you, Joe?!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.220
Brr, it's cold...

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:07.410
Gomamon, come warm me up!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:17.650
Gabumon!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.500
Gabumon Evolution!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.850
Garurumon!

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.720
Fox Fire!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.090
What's this sound?!

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:22.690
Just when the shaking stopped!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.970
Let's wipe them out!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.630
Garurumon...

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.570
Super Evolution!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.250
Weregarurumon!

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.500
Sora-kun! Yamato-kun!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.240
Joe Senpai! Move over real quick!

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.030
Huh?

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.110
Magical Fire!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.330
What is this place?

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.830
A garbage dump?

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.420
I am not garbage!

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.790
Marching Fishes!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.000
Joe!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:43.880
Gomamon!

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.010
Joe, I'm so glad!

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.160
Everybody, lend me a hand!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.230
So many of them...

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.730
How terrible...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.780
From the other side too!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.530
We're surrounded!

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:10.660
We have no choice. Let's escape!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.670
Piyomon, please!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.090
Leave it to me!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.010
Piyomon Evolution!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.430
Birdramon!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.030
T-Too heavy...

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:52.660
It's high, too high!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.910
Everybody, get off there!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.040
Ow, ow, ow...

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:04.400
Sora-kun?!

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.470
I'm going to save the others!

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.670
I knew it.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.720
How come?

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:16.160
If you remember what happened
with Neamon, it's obvious.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:21.190
I knew you wouldn't just leave
those Funbeemon behind.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.440
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:40.640
Sora-kun! Yamato-kun!
Leave the Waspmon to us!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:43.460
Joe Senpai... Ikkakumon!

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.080
There's too many of them.
You have a plan?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:51.150
We'll sneak inside again
and gather all Funbeemon to one location!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:55.470
And I'll carry that entire block away!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.720
I see...

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.660
We'll go in.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.520
Meteor Wing!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.920
In three minutes!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.680
Hurry! This way!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.020
Sora, look!

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:54.700
It's Yamato's cue!

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.590
Let's go, Birdramon!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:57.870
Okay!

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.640
Meteor Wing!

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:41.280
<i>Joe Senpai...</i>

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:45.370
<i>and Yamato opened up a path for us...</i>

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.710
<i>I promise to get through it!</i>

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:53.960
<i>Not just for our world...</i>

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.340
<i>but for the suffering Digimon
in this world...</i>

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.630
<i>I'm going to...</i>

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.050
<i>save you all!</i>

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:12.250
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.030
Garudamon!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.510
GARUDAMON

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.040
An Ultimate Digimon...

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.130
Garudamon!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.870
Shadow Wing!

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.280
Sora!

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:57.380
Okay!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.910
Sora-kun, you're awesome...

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.670
Thank you, Sora!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.200
Everyone, take care!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.570
Take care!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:49.460
Garudamon was amazing, huh?

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:50.290
Yeah.

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:57.170
But that shows
how much power we'll need...

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:58.750
going forward.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.720
I'm finally connected!

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:09.250
This seems like a good place
with reception.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:12.310
The place we're meeting
Yamato-san's team

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:14.850
is past the next canyon...

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:17.330
It's still a long way ahead.

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:22.590
Koshiro, do you know
what's going on in our world?

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.660
Tokyo's situation is...

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.660
Ugh, again...

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:34.130
Like I said, you just give it a good whack
to fix it at times like this!

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:35.290
Wanna try it?

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.380
Th-That's a little...

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:40.110
You're like my grandpa.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:45.010
If you whack it, your hand will hurt.
You want me to do it?

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.350
I'm just kidding, Agumon.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:50.520
Let's get going too!

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:53.120
Okay! Let's go, Taichi!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.330
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.710
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.230
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.430
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:26.900
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:26.900
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:30.890
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:30.850
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:36.580
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.580
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:39.020
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:42.190
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:47.450
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.540
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.490
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.540 --> 00:22:52.830
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.780
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:55.680
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:00.540
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:00.540
